#env MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# ⌘K (Switcher.tsx): the switcher over the frame; words typed narrow it to the test chat, Enter opens it beside the
# list; Esc closes it when opened again; words sent from the chat it opened.
timeout 60000
until 新建对话
until 端到端测试
key cmd+k
until 搜索全部内容和操作
type 端到端
wait 500
shot 1-switcher
enter
gone 搜索全部内容和操作
until 按空格输入
key cmd+k
until 搜索全部内容和操作
key esc
gone 搜索全部内容和操作
tap 按空格输入
type 从切换器打开后发出 {T}
enter
until 从切换器打开后发出 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 2-sent
